---
prometheus:
  stack:
    # Dev's stack is jc-prod's monitoring (T-6727): jc-prod's alert rules, its Alertmanager and the
    # daiya panels read this one Prometheus, so it runs again though the old dev environment is off
    # (RETIRED). Owner order 2026-11-03 had stopped it at 98-100 % node memory; with dev's own
    # workloads at zero it scrapes jc-prod, jc-dev, kube-system and cert-manager only.
    # jc-prod's and jc-dev's exporters (jc's admin listener, APISIX, Postgres) and cert-manager's
    # certificate expiry, which JcProdCertificateExpiresSoon reads (jc-prod's monitoring renders
    # that monitor).
    scrapeNamespaces: [cert-manager, jc-dev, jc-prod]
